Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Waylatch: keep a request moving; keep authority human. Fictional walkthrough, real application.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:09.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Network loss simulated. Preserve the request locally; no server submission or financial action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:16.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Actual offline browser reload: the request survives in IndexedDB. Browser observations are local\Nevidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:22.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bounded QR packets carry request data across disconnection. They carry no payment authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:30.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,A second offline browser decodes an actual QR image and reconstructs the packets. Import stays\Nuntrusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:39.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Real local MiniLM retrieves related wording. The advisory tier separates similarity from transaction\Nidentity; contradictions stay visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:46.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grouped attention and informational comparisons reduce repeated warnings. Related, unrelated or\Ninvestigate never approves a purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:52.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Human REVIEW, AUTHORIZE, buyer approval and separate CAPTURE remain required. Judge financial\Ncontrols are disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:01:00.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Separate historical purchase: USD 1.00 simulated funds, completed capture, USD 0.00 real spending.\NNo checkout is reenacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:07.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Proof Trail names browser, organization and provider sources. Original seven-event audit links\Nvalidate; missing earlier events stay visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:14.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Saved independent PayPal inspection confirms COMPLETED. Viewing this archive makes no provider call\Nand no new purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:27.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Download a sanitized report or independently validate the original SHA-256 chain. An administrator\Ncan rewrite a full database.
